{
  "_comment": "Two mid-turn shapes for tests/deferred-steer-sites.test.mjs. 'open text' leaves a text block open (nothing can fire at a block edge yet). 'question then open' additionally emits a full AskUserQuestion + its deny tool_result FIRST, so the worker has a pending question AND is still mid-turn — the exact state answer_question's own comment describes. The control:interrupt turn is what lets an aborted turn emit a result; without it the session never leaves 'turn' and the test dies on the runner's per-file timeout.",
  "events": [
    { "type": "system", "subtype": "init", "session_id": "$SID", "cwd": "$CWD", "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "permissionMode": "$MODE", "tools": ["Bash"], "uuid": "dss-init-1" }
  ],
  "turns": [
    {
      "on": { "type": "prompt", "text": "open text" },
      "emit": [
        { "type": "stream_event", "event": { "type": "message_start", "message": { "id": "msg_dss1", "role": "assistant" } } },
        { "type": "stream_event", "event": { "type": "content_block_start", "index": 0, "content_block": { "type": "text", "text": "" } } },
        { "type": "stream_event", "event": { "type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": { "type": "text_delta", "text": "answering..." } } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "on": { "type": "prompt", "text": "question then open" },
      "emit": [
        { "type": "stream_event", "event": { "type": "message_start", "message": { "id": "msg_dss_q", "role": "assistant" } } },
        { "type": "stream_event", "event": { "type": "content_block_start", "index": 0, "content_block": { "type": "tool_use", "id": "tu_dss_q", "name": "AskUserQuestion", "input": {} } } },
        { "type": "stream_event", "event": { "type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": { "type": "input_json_delta", "partial_json": "{\"questions\":[{\"question\":\"Pick a fruit\",\"header\":\"Fruit\",\"multiSelect\":false,\"options\":[{\"label\":\"Apple\"},{\"label\":\"Banana\"}]}]}" } } },
        { "type": "stream_event", "event": { "type": "content_block_stop", "index": 0 } },
        { "type": "stream_event", "event": { "type": "message_stop" } },
        { "type": "user", "message": { "role": "user", "content": [ { "type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "tu_dss_q", "content": "Delivered — the user can see your request in the orchestrator UI now. The tool result is flagged as an error only because the reply arrives asynchronously; the tool worked. Do not repeat the call, do not answer or decide it yourself, and do not start other work. End your turn now with no further tool calls and wait for the user's reply; it arrives as a new message.", "is_error": true } ] } },
        { "type": "stream_event", "event": { "type": "message_start", "message": { "id": "msg_dss_after_q", "role": "assistant" } } },
        { "type": "stream_event", "event": { "type": "content_block_start", "index": 0, "content_block": { "type": "text", "text": "" } } },
        { "type": "stream_event", "event": { "type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": { "type": "text_delta", "text": "still working..." } } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Any POST-STOP steer delivery, matched on POST_STOP_STEER_NOTE's own wording so it matches ONLY the deferred path — a live mid-turn injection carries MID_TURN_NOTE, which lacks this clause, and the two mid-turn prompts above carry neither. A COMPLETE turn, so a steered turn reaches turn_end on its own: C-T5 needs a real steered turn_end to spend the one-shot subscription on.",
      "on": { "type": "prompt", "text": "STOPPED at a block boundary" },
      "emit": [
        { "type": "stream_event", "event": { "type": "message_start", "message": { "id": "msg_dss_steered", "role": "assistant" } } },
        { "type": "stream_event", "event": { "type": "content_block_start", "index": 0, "content_block": { "type": "text", "text": "" } } },
        { "type": "stream_event", "event": { "type": "content_block_delta", "index": 0, "delta": { "type": "text_delta", "text": "on it" } } },
        { "type": "stream_event", "event": { "type": "content_block_stop", "index": 0 } },
        { "type": "stream_event", "event": { "type": "message_stop" } },
        { "type": "result", "subtype": "success", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "duration_ms": 5, "total_cost_usd": 0.0001, "is_error": false }
      ]
    },
    {
      "on": { "type": "control", "subtype": "interrupt" },
      "emit": [
        { "type": "user", "message": { "role": "user", "content": [ { "type": "text", "text": "[Request interrupted by user]" } ] }, "parent_tool_use_id": null },
        { "type": "result", "subtype": "error_during_execution", "stop_reason": "interrupted", "duration_ms": 20, "total_cost_usd": 0.0001, "is_error": true }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
